# Archives, packed: no archive is tracked (owner, 2026-11-13: "Git ignore all common archive
# formats (gz, zip, tar) and remove anything already committed from the repo").
# The three formats the owner named are named in capitals too, because a gitignore pattern is
# case-sensitive and a file from a Windows tool is still an archive: gzip `.gz`, `.tgz` and
# `.tar.gz`; zip `.zip`; tar `.tar` with each of the compressed spellings below.
# Each compressor is ignored alone as well, and `.zstd` and `.lzo` are other common names of
# formats already ignored here. No spelling of a format the owner did not name is claimed.
# What a document cites of a removed archive is plain text beside it:
# doc/audit/removed-archives-and-where-history-holds-each.md.
*.tar
*.TAR
*.gz
*.GZ
*.tgz
*.TGZ
*.tar.gz
*.TAR.GZ
*.bz2
*.tbz
*.tbz2
*.tar.bz2
*.xz
*.txz
*.tar.xz
*.zst
*.zstd
*.tzst
*.tar.zst
*.tar.zstd
*.lz4
*.tlz4
*.tar.lz4
*.lzma
*.tlz
*.tar.lzma
*.lz
*.tar.lz
*.lzo
*.tar.lzo
*.Z
*.tar.Z
*.zip
*.ZIP
*.7z
*.tar.7z
*.rar
*.br
*.tar.br

# The three Java archives the owner overrode the `*.jar` ignore for ("Override allowlist
# all 3"): the IntelliJ plugin users install, and the two Gradle wrappers the wrappers
# beside them fetch. Negations are symptoms elsewhere (doc/decision/gitignore-negations.md);
# here the owner ordered the exception.
*.jar
!/package/intellij-plugin/islands-black/islands-black.jar
!/package/linter/kotlin/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
!/package/music-player/android-app/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

