# Kept members of a removed archive that a run names `.log` are records, not scratch. The
# re-include sits below `*.log` because the last matching pattern wins; it covers only the
# optique evidence folder, whose every file is a verbatim member of the archive that folder
# is named after.
!doc/research/optique-typo-suggestion-overhead-upstream-record.evidence/**/*.log

